An Open Map of Work in Progress

Spiral Civilization is under construction.

Project Cooperation is a living map of the questions, tools and systems we are currently developing — and of the places where research, criticism, expertise and creative participation are needed.
We do not need to wait until a concept is finished before making it visible.
Where useful, we publish an early sketch or Prototype Architecture showing:
what we are trying to create,
why we think it may be needed,
what already exists,
what we do not know yet,
what needs to be researched or built,
what knowledge and competencies may be relevant,
and where you can participate.
An unfinished architecture is not presented as a solution.
It is an invitation to help find a better one.
Current Project Cooperation Fields
Prototype Architecture v0.1 — Open for Research and Co-Design
Project Cockpit
A navigation environment integrating tools, reality fields and research methods for recognizing possible trajectories and navigating towards the best possible future.
Multisymbiotic Systems Tool
A multidimensional research and design environment for identifying, mapping and developing systems capable of generating multiple, mutually reinforcing benefits.
Personality Expansion & Identity Games
Playful social and human–AI experiments exploring personality expansion, contextual identity, meaning, creativity, and the conditions in which different possibilities of being can emerge.
Identity Fields Tool
Early Concept — Open for Research
A proposed tool for exploring declared, experienced, aspirational, demonstrated and potentially emerging dimensions of identity.
Best Possible
Research Architecture — In Development
Methods for searching for, comparing and challenging high-potential possibilities without limiting the search to alternatives inherited from the present.
Beautiful Progressiveness Pattern
Early Research Hypothesis
A proposed navigation tool for investigating which trajectories increase not only present value, but the capacity for valuable further development.
Probability Games
Concept / Model Search
A field for exploring existing and new methods of scenario simulation, consequence mapping and testing possible developmental trajectories.
Symbiotic Constellation
Prototype Concept
A multidimensional representation of participants, benefits, costs, risks, relationships, dependencies, missing connections and possibilities generated by a system.
Stars Constellation System
Prototype Concept
A developing visual language for representing multidimensional qualities without reducing complex systems to a single hierarchical score.
Participant Window & Collaboration Map
Priority Prototype
The infrastructure through which people, institutions, research groups, AI systems and other participants can enter particular fields of work while choosing what information remains private and what may become publicly visible.
